<programme start="20261109175400 +0000" stop="20261109185100 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">The Son</title><sub-title lang="es">First Son of Texas</sub-title><desc lang="es">Eli McCullough sobrevive a un ataque comanche en 1849, y en 1915, dirige el imperio de su familia a través de tiempos difíciles.</desc><credits><actor>Pierce Brosnan</actor><actor>Jacob Lofland</actor><actor>Sydney Lucas</actor><actor>David Barnes</actor><actor>Jess Weixler</actor><actor>Henry Garrett</actor><actor>Elizabeth Frances</actor><actor>Paola Núñez</actor><actor>Carlos Bardem</actor><actor>James Parks</actor><actor>Zahn McClarnon</actor></credits><date>20170529</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.0.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E01</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/1e2272a9b9887503ea158751b4551f069f7ac10c.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261109185100 +0000" stop="20261109194300 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">The Son</title><sub-title lang="es">The Plum Tree</sub-title><desc lang="es">El joven Eli aprende a vivir entre los Comanches; Eli y Pete discrepan sobre cómo responder a un ataque contra su casa.</desc><credits><director>Kevin Dowling</director><actor>Pierce Brosnan</actor><actor>Jacob Lofland</actor><actor>Sydney Lucas</actor><actor>David Barnes</actor><actor>Jess Weixler</actor><actor>Henry Garrett</actor><actor>Elizabeth Frances</actor><actor>Paola Núñez</actor><actor>Carlos Bardem</actor><actor>James Parks</actor><actor>Zahn McClarnon</actor><actor>Shane Graham</actor><actor>J. Johnson</actor><actor>Matthew Posey</actor></credits><date>20170529</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.1.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E02</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/a4ff202c115cb89b8ac77f14b96e04694a11dcfd.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261109194300 +0000" stop="20261109203300 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">The Son</title><sub-title lang="es">Second Empire</sub-title><desc lang="es">El joven Eli entrena como un guerrero, pero hace enemigos; Eli y Phineas luchan por ayudar a la familia en Austin; Pete se enfrenta a sus demonios.</desc><credits><actor>Pierce Brosnan</actor><actor>Jacob Lofland</actor><actor>Sydney Lucas</actor><actor>David Barnes</actor><actor>Jess Weixler</actor><actor>Henry Garrett</actor><actor>Elizabeth Frances</actor><actor>Paola Núñez</actor><actor>Carlos Bardem</actor><actor>James Parks</actor><actor>Zahn McClarnon</actor></credits><date>20170415</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.2.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E03</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/de571acf778b36792782b157e4262c051fdb32d0.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261109203300 +0000" stop="20261109212500 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">The Son</title><sub-title lang="es">Death Song</sub-title><desc lang="es">El joven Eli afronta en 1849 un reto que podría costarle la vida. En 1915, la familia McCullough elabora un arriesgado plan para plantar cara a sus enemigos.</desc><credits><actor>Pierce Brosnan</actor><actor>Jacob Lofland</actor><actor>Sydney Lucas</actor><actor>David Barnes</actor><actor>Jess Weixler</actor><actor>Henry Garrett</actor><actor>Elizabeth Frances</actor><actor>Paola Núñez</actor><actor>Carlos Bardem</actor><actor>James Parks</actor><actor>Zahn McClarnon</actor></credits><date>20170422</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.3.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E04</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/ef9f1ddb8e3e398e757c68ae860ef0ff978fbbfc.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261109212500 +0000" stop="20261109221700 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">The Son</title><sub-title lang="es">No Prisoners</sub-title><desc lang="es">En 1849, un enemigo fuerza a Eli a cuestionarse su lealtad. En 1915, el pasado de los McCullough vuelve para atormentarlos con resultados mortales.</desc><credits><actor>Pierce Brosnan</actor><actor>Jacob Lofland</actor><actor>Sydney Lucas</actor><actor>David Barnes</actor><actor>Jess Weixler</actor><actor>Henry Garrett</actor><actor>Elizabeth Frances</actor><actor>Paola Núñez</actor><actor>Carlos Bardem</actor><actor>James Parks</actor><actor>Zahn McClarnon</actor></credits><date>20170429</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/976bbaa58ef80841c04097bb03e6437bf64b70a5.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261109221700 +0000" stop="20261109230600 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">The Son</title><sub-title lang="es">The Buffalo Hunter</sub-title><desc lang="es">El joven Eli debe tomar una decisión cuyas consecuencias entrañan un gran riesgo. Mientras tanto, los McCullough tratan de sobreponerse a la tragedia y Jeannie porfía en salvar a la familia.</desc><credits><actor>Pierce Brosnan</actor><actor>Jacob Lofland</actor><actor>Sydney Lucas</actor><actor>David Barnes</actor><actor>Jess Weixler</actor><actor>Henry Garrett</actor><actor>Elizabeth Frances</actor><actor>Paola Núñez</actor><actor>Carlos Bardem</actor><actor>James Parks</actor><actor>Zahn McClarnon</actor></credits><date>20170506</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E06</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/63e130bedb4464359baa07c7e52f612cf1559243.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261109230600 +0000" stop="20261109235900 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">The Son</title><sub-title lang="es">Marriage Bond</sub-title><desc lang="es">El joven Eli debe transitar con cuidado por el complicado mundo de las políticas tribales. Una crisis obliga a Peter y Sally a tomar una decisión que cambiará a la familia.</desc><credits><actor>Pierce Brosnan</actor><actor>Jacob Lofland</actor><actor>Sydney Lucas</actor><actor>David Barnes</actor><actor>Jess Weixler</actor><actor>Henry Garrett</actor><actor>Elizabeth Frances</actor><actor>Paola Núñez</actor><actor>Carlos Bardem</actor><actor>James Parks</actor><actor>Zahn McClarnon</actor></credits><date>20170513</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.6.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E07</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/75d7673826d1c363f81cfb7bc6dd1f705d28f73c.jpg"/></programme>
