<programme start="20261107203000 +0000" stop="20261108000000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Temple at Navy</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Temple Owls (2-6) face the Navy Midshipmen (2-6) at Navy-Marine Corps Memorial Stadium. Temple seeks to end a three-game losing streak after falling 17-9 to East Carolina, while Navy seeks to snap a skid as well after falling 35-13 to Notre Dame.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108000000 +0000" stop="20261108033000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Sam Houston State at Jacksonville State</sub-title><desc lang="en">First meets worst as the Gamecocks (6-2, 4-0 Conference USA) host the Bearkats (1-7, 0-4). Jacksonville State has won three consecutive meetings. Gamecocks dual-threat quarterback Caden Creel has thrown 13 touchdown passes and rushed for five scores.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108033000 +0000" stop="20261108070000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Wyoming at UNLV</sub-title><desc lang="en">UNLV Rebels meet Wyoming Cowboys at Allegiant Stadium. UNLV relies on scoring from a 31-24 victory on Nov 1, while Wyoming counts on defensive takeaways after recovering three fumbles in a 28-14 win on Oct 24 to claim a Mountain West victory.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
