<programme start="20261108045200 +0000" stop="20261108055100 +0000" channel="Curiosity 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Ancient Murders Unearthed</title><sub-title lang="en">Rosemarkie Man</sub-title><desc lang="en">Homicide detective Rod Demery and forensic scientist Turi King examine a skeleton dated to the time of the Picts and unearthed in a remote sea cave in Scotland; the team recreate the attack to deduce the victim&apos;s most likely killer.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><category lang="en">History</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p24517193_b_s4_ah.jpg"/></programme>
