<programme start="20261107170000 +0000" stop="20261107200000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Texas at Missouri</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 7 Texas Longhorns (6-2) visit the No. 18 Missouri Tigers (6-2) at Memorial Stadium for an SEC game. Missouri beat Arkansas 34-10 behind two Austin Simmons touchdowns, while Texas seeks three straight wins after beating Mississippi State 31-3.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107200000 +0000" stop="20261107230000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Texas A&amp;M at South Carolina</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 21 South Carolina Gamecocks (5-3) host the Texas A&amp;M Aggies at Williams-Brice Stadium. Texas A&amp;M enters off a 31-20 loss to Alabama and relies on Marcel Reed, while South Carolina beat Oklahoma 42-25 behind LaNorris Sellers&apos; three touchdowns.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
