<programme start="20261107231500 +0000" stop="20261108021500 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Kentucky at Tennessee</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 13 Tennessee Volunteers clash with the No. 6 Kentucky Wildcats in an SEC matchup. Tennessee has 39 quarterback hits to defend home turf after five straight rivalry wins, while Kentucky leans on a one-interception record over eight games.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
