<programme start="20261108190000 +0000" stop="20261108223000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Miami at Notre Dame</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 1 Miami Hurricanes (8-0) face the No. 11 Notre Dame Fighting Irish (7-1) at Notre Dame Stadium. Miami enters this matchup undefeated after beating North Carolina, 38-35, while Notre Dame beat Navy, 35-13, behind C.J. Carr&apos;s two touchdowns.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261108223000 +0000" stop="20261109020000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Michigan State at Michigan</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Wolverines (5-3, 2-3 Big Ten) and Spartans (2-6, 0-5) play for the Paul Bunyan Trophy. Michigan leads the series 75-38-5 after winning the last four meetings by a combined 133-44 score. Michigan State has dropped eight consecutive road games.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
