<programme start="20261108050000 +0000" stop="20261108053000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">Super Bowl Highlights</title><sub-title lang="en">Super Bowl 50: Carolina Panthers vs. Denver Broncos</sub-title><desc lang="en">Von Miller and the Denver defense harassed Panthers quarterback Cam Newton all game long and the Broncos made enough big plays for a 24-10 victory. From Feb. 7, 2016 at Levi&apos;s Stadium in Santa Clara, Calif.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p496084_b_v8_ag.jpg"/></programme>
