<programme start="20261107211500 +0000" stop="20261108001500 +0000" channel="SEC ESPN Network"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Vanderbilt at Mississippi State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Mississippi State Bulldogs play the Vanderbilt Commodores in an SEC match at Davis Wade Stadium. Mississippi State looks to rebound after a loss to Texas, while Vanderbilt leans on late fourth-quarter adjustments to secure a win on the road.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
