<programme start="20261108004500 +0000" stop="20261108040000 +0000" channel="SEC ESPN Network"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Oklahoma at Florida</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Oklahoma Sooners (4-4) visit No. 24 Florida Gators at Ben Hill Griffin Stadium for an SEC clash. Oklahoma fell 42-25 to South Carolina and relies on quarterback John Mateer, while Florida lost 27-8 to Georgia and looks to quarterback Aaron Philo.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
