<programme start="20261108090000 +0000" stop="20261108120000 +0000" channel="SEC ESPN Network"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Arkansas at Auburn</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Tigers (4-2, 2-4 SEC) step off the Top 25 train to host the Razorbacks (3-5, 1-4). Auburn has played four straight ranked teams, going 1-3 with a 27-24 triumph at then-No. 1 Georgia. Auburn leads the series 21-13-1 after winning 33-24 in 2025.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
